      "text": "输入\n                            5\r\n7\r\n3 8\r\n8 1 0\r\n2 7 4 4\r\n4 5 2 6 5\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            5,2->4,2->3,1->2,1->1,1\r\n30"
